# Siebentaschen

> Premium and luxury fashion from designer brands, spanning clothing, shoes, bags, accessories, kidswear, and home collections.

Siebentaschen is an independent multi-brand retailer offering premium and luxury fashion from Italian wholesale distributors below original retail prices. Collections include women’s and men’s clothing, shoes, bags, accessories, kids’ items, home products, and brands such as Jacquemus, Bottega Veneta, Balenciaga, Burberry, and Dolce & Gabbana.

